          "copies/ps931qh5746.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "pencil at the top edge of the paper, read from the upright panel and cross-checked against the rotated one. The month figure is the open-loop form that can pass for a 6, but under magnification it shows a closed upper loop crossing at the waist into a closed bowl, so 8. Points after the day, the month and the year. Nothing else written on this crop."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
